WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.530
When two tickets look similar, select them in Split view and compare their descriptions without leaving the list.

00:00:06.530 --> 00:00:13.440
Distinguish the failed microphone from the separate replacement cable request; different work can share equipment and staff.

00:00:13.440 --> 00:00:18.370
Open the right record before adding a note so the evidence stays with the incident it describes.
